The authors of track3r-os
=========================

trak3r-os  -  creator and maintainer

"The track3r-os authors" in the copyright lines of the source files (and in the module SDK's MIT
licence, module/sdk/LICENSE) means the people listed here. The file headers are not edited when
this list grows.

Code from other projects keeps its own authors and licence: see THIRD_PARTY.md.
